    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jofonji ma twodo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cuny waco kamaler ni ji megi jobino weyo yeyo i ndir ma bino, jobino winjo cuny ma jotwodo to joluwo fonji pa jwogi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fonji no wok i twodo pa ji ma jorendere, ma paro ma cuny jo otho aka orere woko pa gima nyweny malieth owaŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joma pameno jofonjo ni nywom rac, aka jocero ji camo cemo moro. To Were ocweyo cemo me acama, ma jom'oyeyo aka joŋeyo adieri jooro munyo jofoyo Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gimoro je ma Were ocweyo ber, ongoye gima wocayi, to wojol je gi kwayo munyo ifoyo Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ato wac pa Were kodi kwayo miyo Were ketho silwany i gino.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jatic maber mapa Kristo Yesu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "K'ifonjo jom'oyeyo wac me, ibino bedo jatic maber mapa Kristo Yesu, m'odongo gi wac ma yeyo kodi fonji ma go otieko mako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To weyi woko kigana ma Were ongoy'iye, ma kiripi awaca. Bedi munyo ifonjere kwo ma sangala Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kada fonjo del wobedi m'ocwiny nitie gi kony moro, to bedo gi kwo ma sangala Were ama nitie gi kony i royo je, rupiri nitie i iye cikirok ma kwo ma pama kodi ma bino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Me wac m'otire ma ripo ajola kicutho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno am'omiyo watekere aka watiyo gi tekirok, rupiri waketho geno mawan i Were makwo m'obedo Jaboth pa ji je, to tektek mere apa jom'oyeyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wodhi or aka fonji gigipiny me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'iyey moro wocayin ro thino perin, to bedi ranen ri jom'oyeyo, i luwo, i kula, i mar, i yeyo kodi i lonyo ma cuny jo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Or hongo perin i kisoma ri ji Ndiko Maleŋ, kodi fonji cuka anobin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikir'ijala mic ma cuny ma inigine, m'omiyin munyo jotuci wac Were joluwo kwoŋe i ndir ma jodongo pa jom'oyeyo joketh'iye cingi gin kwoŋin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kethi tic no je i tim munyo imiyere rijo, ŋey ji je jowoneni paka tic perin kadho malo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1TI 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "In won kaŋasa kwo perin, aka kaŋasa fonji perin bende. Medere gi timo tic no, rupiri k'itimo ameno ibino bothere kiri gi joma jowinjin bende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1TI.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1TI.4.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
